# Misc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
Thumbs.db

# apps/be/scripts/ is a working scratchpad (seed runs, one-off migrations, dedupe
# passes) and stays out of the repo by default. A script or migration is tracked
# ONLY when a tracked doc names it as part of a documented, reproducible
# procedure — otherwise the doc makes a promise nobody outside this machine can
# run. Add an exception here at the same time you add that reference, not before.
apps/be/scripts/*
# named in docs/architecture/google-place-photo-fallback.md
!apps/be/scripts/backfill_google_place_ids.py
!apps/be/scripts/migrations/
apps/be/scripts/migrations/*
# same doc, same reason
!apps/be/scripts/migrations/015_google_photo_usage.sql

# docs/ is local-only (handoff notes, engineering log, product/plans drafts) except
# docs/architecture/, which is the public design-doc set and ships with the repo.
docs/*
!docs/architecture/

# Temporary/Development files
*.tmp
*.temp

